d of being looked up again   after it, where the exception of a missing one is already handled - The corresponding loop for the objective function is unchanged:   LinearObjectiveFunction::add(term) pushes the term back without searching,   and a bulk add there would merge the terms, which is a change in behavior","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"kizuna-ai-lab/sokuji","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-26T10:40:49Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"e7cf101d5cb37e9c3432b5540130c2c8270e4a15","github_link":"https://github.com/kizuna-ai-lab/sokuji/commit/e7cf101d5cb37e9c3432b5540130c2c8270e4a15","commit_subject":"feat(session): the start gate runs live, so Start says why before it is pressed","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"patrickchugh/terravision","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-26T10:40:43Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"a4c7edc32662fd0077339a4eebdd8ff61e795ad6","github_link":"https://github.com/patrickchugh/terravision/commit/a4c7edc32662fd0077339a4eebdd8ff61e795ad6","commit_subject":"fix(mcp): give the diagram view a content-hashed URI so hosts reload it","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"capitec/dsp-decision-engine","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-26T10:40:31Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"91b9c08f16cdad161003172b8715df75647e0f7a","github_link":"https://github.com/capitec/dsp-decision-engine/commit/91b9c08f16cdad161003172b8715df75647e0f7a","commit_subject":"Make a Raw[str] code cost nothing on a single record","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"pymedphys/pymedphys","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-26T10:40:11Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"59eb775adf3a1dd14323f0dea021b10f8d4a2815","github_link":"https://github.com/pymedphys/pymedphys/commit/59eb775adf3a1dd14323f0dea021b10f8d4a2815","commit_subject":"Merge the updated #2061 base into claude/deid-02-legacy-log-hygiene","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"artsy/eigen","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-26T10:40:05Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"b9206f5c098270a0ba8ea4624e4dd3a74ac125d1","github_link":"https://github.com/artsy/eigen/commit/b9206f